        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;In Blind Trust, communication isn't optional — it's your only way to survive.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blind Trust is a 2–5 player online co-op platformer that challenges your teamwork like never before. One player sees a world full of deadly traps and hazards, while the others see only a peaceful landscape. The sighted guide the blind through tense platforming challenges using voice, timing, and trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal: escape a burning city by making your way to the jail on the far side of the map — the only safe haven left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a player falls, everyone fails — the game resets, the roles rotate, and the challenge begins again from a fresh perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to navigating deadly terrain, your team must work together to solve a complex maze by driving cars with chaotic physics, requiring coordination and skill from all players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ability to slow time to survive tight situations and master the art of communication under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2–5 Player Online Co-Op</strong> – Teamwork and trust drive every moment. <strong><i>For the smoothest gameplay, the player with the more powerful PC should host the session.</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Vision</strong> – One player sees danger; others see calm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Falls, All Fall</strong> – A single mistake resets the whole team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Role Rotation</strong> – Each reset changes who leads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Car Maze</strong> – Solve a challenging maze together, controlling unpredictable vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow Time Mechanic</strong> – Briefly slow down time to avoid disaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense &amp; Unforgettable</strong> – Experience a rollercoaster of chaos, teamwork, and laughs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One leader. Many followers. One mistake — and it all resets. Can your team survive <i>Blind Trust</i>?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;In Blind Trust, communication isn't optional — it's your only way to survive.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blind Trust is a 2–5 player online co-op platformer that challenges your teamwork like never before. One player sees a world full of deadly traps and hazards, while the others see only a peaceful landscape. The sighted guide the blind through tense platforming challenges using voice, timing, and trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal: escape a burning city by making your way to the jail on the far side of the map — the only safe haven left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a player falls, everyone fails — the game resets, the roles rotate, and the challenge begins again from a fresh perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to navigating deadly terrain, your team must work together to solve a complex maze by driving cars with chaotic physics, requiring coordination and skill from all players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ability to slow time to survive tight situations and master the art of communication under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2–5 Player Online Co-Op</strong> – Teamwork and trust drive every moment. <strong><i>For the smoothest gameplay, the player with the more powerful PC should host the session.</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric Vision</strong> – One player sees danger; others see calm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Falls, All Fall</strong> – A single mistake resets the whole team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Role Rotation</strong> – Each reset changes who leads.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic Car Maze</strong> – Solve a challenging maze together, controlling unpredictable vehicles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow Time Mechanic</strong> – Briefly slow down time to avoid disaster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense &amp; Unforgettable</strong> – Experience a rollercoaster of chaos, teamwork, and laughs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One leader. Many followers. One mistake — and it all resets. Can your team survive <i>Blind Trust</i>?</p>",
